# iCloud Drive conflict copies. This checkout lives under ~/Documents,
# which iCloud syncs, and a sync conflict drops byte-identical
# "<name> 2.py" copies across the tree — 185 of them in one event,
# including inside .git/refs/. These lines only keep `git status`
# readable and keep a `git add -A` from committing the duplicates; they
# do NOT stop one breaking the build, because adapter discovery
# (pkgutil.walk_packages over instruments/) imports an ignored file just
# the same and re-registers every adapter key, killing `import labpilot`
# outright. The real fix is excluding this folder from iCloud sync.
* 2.*
* 3.*
* 2/
* 3/
